{"sha": "9c91abd86fb5e456f180d71622fdb985c99a235705151ee8837d3bb89f33b59f", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "对 $E_r = -\\dd V/\\dd r$ 积分，所用的场见", "\\cref{prop:b1:electrostatics-gauss:three}：球体由无穷远向内积分", "（在 $R$ 处的连续性确定内部的积分常数）；导线由 $r_0$ 处积分；", "电容器则沿间隙积分。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, width=10cm, height=5.8cm,", "    xlabel={$r/R$}, ylabel={},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.1)}, anchor=north},", "    xmin=0, xmax=4, ymin=0, ymax=1.7, xtick={1,2,3}, ytick={0.5,1,1.5}, samples=80, clip=false]", "  \\addplot[omProp, very thick, domain=0:1] {1.5-0.5*x^2};", "  \\addplot[omProp, very thick, domain=1:4] {1/x};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:3.95,1.5) {$V$（单位 $Q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R$）};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, dashed, domain=0:1] {x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, dashed, domain=1:4] {1/x^2};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:3.95,1.27) {$E$（单位 $Q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R^2$）};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.05,1.58) {$V(0) = \\tfrac32\\,V(R)$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 均匀带电球体的电势（实线）与电场（虚线）。", "电势连续，斜率也连续；球内电势为抛物线，", "此处电场为线性；球外电势为 $1/r$ 形式。电势的", "最大值位于球心，该处电场为零——$V$ 的极大值", "点是零场点，反之不成立。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[电子伏特（再谈）]\\label{ex:b1:potential-capacitors:eV}", "一个电子穿过 \\qty{100}{V} 的间隙，获得 $eU = \\qty{100}{eV} =", "\\qty{1.6e-17}{J}$，无论两电极之间的电场形状如何，", "电势使路径无关紧要", "（见\\cref{def:b1:charged-particles:eV}）。一个 \\qty{1}{\\micro C} 的电荷与另一电荷相距", "\\qty{1}{m}，此时 $V = \\qty{9}{kV}$，两者共储存", "\\qty{9}{mJ}；金原子核中心的电势为", "\\qty{24}{MV}（见\\cref{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:6}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{电偶极子}", "", "\\begin{definition}[电偶极子]\\label{def:b1:potential-capacitors:dipole}", "\\index{电偶极子}\\index{偶极矩}", "两个异号电荷 $-q$ 位于 $N$、$+q$ 位于 $P$，相距 $a = NP$，", "构成一个\\emph{电偶极子}，其\\emph{偶极矩}为", "$\\vect p = q\\,\\vect{NP}$（\\unit{C.m}），方向由 $-$ 指向 $+$。偶极近似", "即研究其在距离 $r \\gg a$ 处的场。一个分子，若其正、负电荷", "中心不重合，便是电偶极子（如水，$p = \\qty{6.2e-30}{C.m}$）；", "处于电场中的中性原子也会变为电偶极子", "（感应偶极子）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[电偶极子的场]\\label{prop:b1:potential-capacitors:dipolefield}", "设点 $M$ 满足 $OM = r \\gg a$（$O$ 为 $NP$ 的中点），$\\theta$ 为", "$\\vect p$ 与 $\\vect{OM}$ 之间的夹角，则", "\\[", "V(M) = \\frac{p\\cos\\theta}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 r^2}, \\qquad", "E_r = \\frac{2p\\cos\\theta}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3}, \\qquad", "E_\\theta = \\frac{p\\sin\\theta}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3} .", "\\]", "偶极子的场按 $1/r^3$ 衰减，比点电荷的 $1/r^2$", "衰减更快：远处两电荷近乎相互抵消，", "剩下的则是两者的间距。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$V = \\dfrac{q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0}\\Bigl(\\dfrac1{PM} - \\dfrac1{NM}\\Bigr)$，其中", "$PM \\approx r - \\tfrac a2\\cos\\theta$ 且 $NM \\approx r + \\tfrac a2\\cos\\theta$", "（$\\pm\\tfrac a2$ 在 $\\vect{OM}$ 上的投影）；保留到 $a/r$ 的一阶，", "由此 $1/PM - 1/NM \\approx a\\cos\\theta/r^2$。于是 $E_r = -\\partial V/\\partial r$ 且", "$E_\\theta = -(1/r)\\,\\partial V/\\partial\\theta$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, >=Stealth]", "  \\begin{scope}[scale=1.3]", "    \\fill[omDef] (-0.5,0) circle (2.5pt) node[below left, font=\\footnotesize] {$-q$};", "    \\fill[omThm] (0.5,0) circle (2.5pt) node[below right, font=\\footnotesize] {$+q$};", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (-0.5,0) -- (0.5,0); \\node[above, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,0.05) {$\\vect p$};", "    \\fill (0,0) circle (1pt); \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-0.05) {$O$};", "    \\coordinate (M) at (2.6,1.9);", "    \\fill (M) circle (1.6pt) node[above right, font=\\footnotesize] {$M$};", "    \\draw[dashed] (0,0) -- (M) node[midway, above left, font=\\footnotesize] {$r$};", "    \\draw[dashed] (-0.5,0) -- (M); \\draw[dashed] (0.5,0) -- (M);", "    \\draw (0.9,0) arc[start angle=0, end angle=36, radius=0.9] node[midway, right, font=\\footnotesize] {$\\theta$};", "    \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (M) -- ++(36:0.9) node[right, font=\\footnotesize] {$E_r$};", "    \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (M) -- ++(126:0.6) node[above left, font=\\footnotesize] {$E_\\theta$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.6cm, scale=1.0]", "    % field lines: circles through the charges (dipole limit: r = K sin^2 theta)", "    \\foreach \\K in {0.8,1.6,2.6} {", "      \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=3:177, samples=60, smooth] plot ({\\K*sin(\\x)*sin(\\x)*cos(\\x)}, {\\K*sin(\\x)*sin(\\x)*sin(\\x)});", "      \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=183:357, samples=60, smooth] plot ({\\K*sin(\\x)*sin(\\x)*cos(\\x)}, {\\K*sin(\\x)*sin(\\x)*sin(\\x)});", "    }", "    % equipotentials r = A sqrt(|cos theta|)", "    \\foreach \\A in {0.9,1.5,2.2} {", "      \\draw[omProp, thick, domain=-88:88, samples=50, smooth] plot ({\\A*sqrt(cos(\\x))*cos(\\x)}, {\\A*sqrt(cos(\\x))*sin(\\x)});", "      \\draw[omProp, thick, domain=92:268, samples=50, smooth] plot ({\\A*sqrt(-cos(\\x))*cos(\\x)}, {\\A*sqrt(-cos(\\x))*sin(\\x)});", "    }", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (-0.25,0) -- (0.25,0);", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omProp] at (2.95,0.45) {$V > 0$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omProp] at (-2.95,0.45) {$V < 0$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左图：偶极近似的几何关系 --- $M$ 点从", "中心 $O$ 处观察，距离为 $r$，所成夹角为 $\\theta$（相对 $\\vect p$），并标出", "径向与横向场分量。右图：场线（蓝色，", "$r \\propto \\sin^2\\theta$）与等势线（橙色，$r \\propto", "\\sqrt{|\\cos\\theta|}$）为指向右方的偶极子的场线与等势线；过 $O$", "且垂直于 $\\vect p$ 的平面，是等势面 $V = 0$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}